    "updated_at": "2019-07-26T04:14:06Z",
    "body": "This module is going to need to interface with the shell, since we need the shell to tell us when command execution has started. Would the best design be to make the module timer public within `mod` so that we can add a starship subcommand? Or is there some better way to do that?\r\n",
